IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-credit-points-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-s33a-credit-point`
IMPORT `ito-s34-s36-s36a-credits`
IMPORT `ito-credit-points-published-figures`

-- ===========================================================================
-- INDEPENDENT tests for row IL-01 (ITO ss 33A, 34, 36, 36A).
--
-- Every expected value below was decided from the Hebrew source BEFORE this
-- author opened any .l4 file of the encoding, and is recorded with its
-- licence in DECIDED-ANSWERS.md (finished 2026-10-06T14:02:44Z). Scenario ids
-- (S01 ...) are that file's. This file only re-expresses those answers through
-- the encoding's exported names.
--
-- A failing assertion is a finding. None has been edited to match the code.
-- Scenarios that the encoding's interface cannot express are listed at the
-- end as comments and in INDEPENDENT-FINDINGS.md; they are not dropped.
